            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "State the condensed electron configuration for (a) a tungsten atom and (b) a tungsten(IV) ion. Determine the series to which tungsten belongs."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4041772187",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "- - - - -"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2224536353",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Tungsten (W) is element 74 in the periodic table. The electron configuration for W is: 1"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
